# P103 on AppKit, part 1: a tap toggles, a long press opens the picker and does NOT toggle.
# Positions from the AppKit window on 2026-10-17 (960x1696 px = 480x848 pt at 2x; origin=frame, 28 pt title bar):
# rows' emoji at x 43, y 242 (停車場) / 286 (便利商店) / 330 (加油站); SOLO emoji at 85,428.
# Pass (p103-emoji.log): "ROW 停車場 off", then "SOLO on"; NO "ROW 便利商店 off" for the long press, and the
# final screenshot shows the picker sheet for 便利商店 with 🏪 first on purple.
# P103 在 AppKit 上第一部分：點一下切換，長按叫出選擇器且**不**切換。通過條件見上方英文。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P103 lay out,macos
click,43,242,frame,left,,,停車場: a tap switches it off,macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,,macos
click,85,428,frame,left,,,SOLO: a tap switches it on,macos
sleep,,,,,,800000,,macos
mousedown,43,286,frame,left,,,便利商店: press (the AppKit synthesiser has no longpress verb),macos
sleep,,,,,,900000,held 0.9 s -- past the 0.5 s long-press delay; the picker opens,macos
mouseup,43,286,frame,left,,,let go -- no toggle may be logged,macos
sleep,,,,,,1500000,leave the sheet open for the final screenshot,macos
